  "verdict": "XGBoost champion wins on 15/15 sampled series (mean WAPE 24.78% vs Holt-Winters 45.36%). XGBoost's advantage comes from using cross-series features (price, promotion, weather, holiday flags) that a single-series time-series model cannot see at all \u2014 Holt-Winters only ever looks at that one item's own history. Holt-Winters remains valuable as a fast, interpretable, zero-training-data fallback for brand-new items with no feature history yet."
